TITLE Calcite kinetics with Cu and Ba at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
RATES
CustomCalcite
-start
10 rate = PARM(1) * PARM(2)
20 moles = rate * TIME
30 if (moles > M) then moles = M
40 SAVE moles
-end
KINETICS 1
CustomCalcite
    -formula Calcite 1
    -m0 1
    -m 1
    -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 1000 in 100
END
